/**
 * Parses a heading, if one exists, from a provided string.
 *
 * ## Notes
 *
 * -   Heading examples:
 *
 *     -   Markdown heading:
 *
 *         ```
 *         # Foo
 *         ```
 *
 *     -   Markdown heading (alternative style):
 *
 *         ```
 *         Foo
 *         ===
 *         ```
 *
 *         ```
